    "teach": "Read this out:\n“The green flag is an event. Something happens because you started it.”\n\nThen say it in your own words:\nYear 3 write a short program about “Events and the green flag”.\n\nWrite these words up and read the meanings:\nevent — Something that starts code, such as clicking the green flag.\nstart — The first thing that makes the code run.\nclick — Pressing a button, flag or sprite with the mouse.\ntrigger — The thing that makes the next bit of code happen.\nresponse — What the program does after an event.\ninteractive — The program listens to you (clicks, keys, sensors).\n\nTell them what “finished” looks like:\n1. Build a short program that shows “Events and the green flag”\n2. Run it and say what each main block does\n3. Change one thing, predict, then test\n\nAfter the talk task, open ByteBuddies if logins work. If they do not, stay on paper — that still counts as the lesson.\n\nYou are teaching Year 3: Events and the green flag. You do not need extra computing knowledge beyond this page.",
    "teachScript": "Read this out:\n“The green flag is an event. Something happens because you started it.”\n\nThen say it in your own words:\nYear 3 write a short program about “Events and the green flag”.\n\nWrite these words up and read the meanings:\nevent — Something that starts code, such as clicking the green flag.\nstart — The first thing that makes the code run.\nclick — Pressing a button, flag or sprite with the mouse.\ntrigger — The thing that makes the next bit of code happen.\nresponse — What the program does after an event.\ninteractive — The program listens to you (clicks, keys, sensors).\n\nTell them what “finished” looks like:\n1. Build a short program that shows “Events and the green flag”\n2. Run it and say what each main block does\n3. Change one thing, predict, then test\n\nAfter the talk task, open ByteBuddies if logins work. If they do not, stay on paper — that still counts as the lesson.\n\nYou are teaching Year 3: Events and the green flag. You do not need extra computing knowledge beyond this page.",
